" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2023-10-19_10-22-48.png" data=
-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-con=
tent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"73302642" data=
-linked-resource-container-version=3D"6" data-media-id=3D"45dd1fcd-3410-493=
f-8a14-20ed688651e2" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"245"></span>
<p></p></li>
<li>
<p>In the area <strong>PXE Configuration</strong>, select the version of th=
e IGEL OS Base System you want to install and the validity period for the a=
uthentication token that enables access to the App Portal.</p><span class=
=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-embedded=
-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-im=
age-border image-left" width=3D"400" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"edb451792ca621=
67e4b9eabed9a8b352d7aa88ac62b036132630ce6ef505ff86" data-image-src=3D"https=
://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302642/image-2023-10=
-19_10-29-28.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1716364687434&amp;cache=
Version=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"725" data-width=3D"323" data-unres=
olved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73308719" data-linked-=
