pe=3D"file" height=3D"900"></span>
<p><br>
The file <code>pxe-config.json</code> is downloaded by your browser.</p></l=
i>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"HowtoDeployIGELOS12withPXE-Editingthe&quot;pxe-config.json&quot;F=
IleEditingthepxeconfig">Editing the "pxe-config.json" FIle<span class=3D"co=
nfluence-anchor-link" id=3D"HowtoDeployIGELOS12withPXE-Editingthepxeconfig"=
><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Editingthepxeconfig"></span><=
/span></h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>In the OSC ZIP file (example: <code>osc_12.2.1_pxe.zip</code>), check ou=
t the contents of the <code>webserver/</code> directory. We will create a r=
eference for each file in step 2.<br>
Example:<br><code>osc.bspl</code><br><code>osc.nvgfx</code><br><code>osc.sy=
s</code><br></p></li>
<li>
<p>Edit <code>pxe-config.json</code> as follows:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><code>"osc"/"partitions"</code>: Enter a list of the URLs of the files t=
o be downloaded from your web server. The format is <code>http://&lt;WEB SE=
RVER ADDRESS&gt;/&lt;PATH&gt;/&lt;FILENAME&gt;</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><code>"apps"/"version"</code>: Ensure that the desired version of IGEL O=
S is specified.</p>
<p><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"5c39762f-70e3-44b5-add=
2-b0d94de5324a">Example:</span></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "osc": {
        "partitions": [
            "http://igel-pxe-weberver/osc.bspl",
 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;"http://igel-pxe-weberver/osc.nvg=
fx",
 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;"http://igel-pxe-weberver/osc.sys=
" &nbsp;=20
        ]
    },
    "appdata": {
        "app_portal": "https://app.igel.com/api/",
        "auth_token": "eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJSUzUxMiJ9.eyJmaW5nZXJwcml=
udCI6IjQ2Njc
E4NkMyMTk4Njg3MUIzMEUwMzU3NUQ5Q0NFRTQzNUJGRkU3M0IxQjYxRkMiLCJib2R5Ijp7InVtc=
0lkIjoiVU1TL
