<p></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"HowtoDeployIGELOS12withPXE-ProvingthePXEConfigurationFile(pxe-con=
fig.json)viatheTFTPServer">Proving the PXE Configuration File (pxe-config.j=
son) via the TFTP Server&nbsp;</h3>
<p>=E2=86=92 <span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"08ee4c0c-177=
9-4dc4-898d-c73767159da4">Copy </span><code><span class=3D"inline-comment-m=
arker" data-ref=3D"08ee4c0c-1779-4dc4-898d-c73767159da4">pxe-config.json</s=
pan></code><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"08ee4c0c-1779-=
4dc4-898d-c73767159da4"> to </span><code><span class=3D"inline-comment-mark=
er" data-ref=3D"08ee4c0c-1779-4dc4-898d-c73767159da4">&lt;TFTP ROOT&gt;/ima=
ges/</span></code><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"08ee4c0=
c-1779-4dc4-898d-c73767159da4">. Example file path: </span><code><span clas=
s=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"08ee4c0c-1779-4dc4-898d-c73767159da=
4">C:\TFTP-Root\images\pxe-config.json</span></code></p>
<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"HowtoDeployIGELOS12withPXE-ConfiguringtheWebServer(IIS)">Configur=
ing the Web Server (IIS)</h2>
<p>For installing the components of IGEL OS 12, we need a web server. In ou=
r example, we will use the Microsoft Internet Information Server (IIS).<br>=
</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>If IIS is not already available on your Windows server, install it.<br><=
/p></li>
<li>
<p><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"505277fd-407a-4db2-a58=
d-0706cbd5b995">Add the file name extensions and the corresponding MIME typ=
es for all file types that are present in the </span><code><span class=3D"i=
nline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"505277fd-407a-4db2-a58d-0706cbd5b995">web=
server/</span></code><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"5052=
77fd-407a-4db2-a58d-0706cbd5b995"> directory of the OSC ZIP file. In our ex=
ample</span>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>File name extension</strong> <code>.bspl</code>; <strong>MIME ty=
pe</strong> <code>application/octet stream</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>File name extension</strong>: <code>.sys</code>; <strong>MIME ty=
pe</strong> <code>application/octet stream</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>File name extension</strong>: <code>.nvgfx</code>; <strong>MIME =
type</strong> <code>application/octet stream</code><br></p><span class=3D"c=
onfluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-ma=
nual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image=
-border image-center" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"1730129fd184037=
3c1a13c4988a8940e8a704ff818b146d71e1e2a73a473aab9" data-image-src=3D"https:=
//igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302642/image-2023-9-2=
7_16-17-17.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1716364687466&amp;cacheVe=
rsion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"830" data-width=3D"1280" data-unreso=
lved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73308939" data-linked-r=
esource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-=
resource-default-alias=3D"image-2023-9-27_16-17-17.png" data-base-url=3D"ht=
tps://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"im=
age/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"73302642" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-version=3D"6" data-media-id=3D"4818921c-9f3f-418e-9671-c4c7e530=
224a" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"303"></span>
<p></p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Specify a directory in which the required files will be stored, in our e=
xample <code>C:\HTTP-Root</code><br></p></li>
<li>
<p><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"ad733c00-a714-4644-b86=
e-b01c984c689f">Copy all files from the </span><code><span class=3D"inline-=
comment-marker" data-ref=3D"ad733c00-a714-4644-b86e-b01c984c689f">webserver=
/</span></code><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"ad733c00-a=
714-4644-b86e-b01c984c689f"> direc</span>tory of the OSC ZIP file into the =
directory on the web server that has been defined in the section <code>"osc=
"/"partitions"</code> of your <code>pxe-config.json</code>&nbsp;(see <a hre=
f=3D"#Editingthepxeconfig" rel=3D"nofollow">Editing the "pxe-config.json" F=
ile</a>). In our example, the directory is <code>C:\HTTP-Root</code> and th=
e files are <code>osc.bspl</code>, <code>osc.nvgfx</code>, and <code>osc.sy=
s</code>. The files may vary depending on the version of your OSC ZIP file.=
</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip=
">
<p class=3D"title">Web Server Check</p><span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-sma=
ll aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>We recommend checking the URLs for these files in a web browser to ensur=
e the download is functional.</p>
</div>
</div></li>
</ol>
<h2 id=3D"HowtoDeployIGELOS12withPXE-InstallingIGELOSviaPXE">Installing IGE=
L OS via PXE</h2>
<p>=E2=86=92 Start the devices in your PXE environment.&nbsp;<br>
If everything has been set up correctly, your devices boot into IGEL OS 12.=
</p>
<p></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
